code_method":"nearest_centroid","resource_code":"205"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[140.6074676513672,38.0848388671875]}}],"display_comment_original":"蔵王町周辺には、近世村の記憶として宮村、曲竹村、塩沢村などの旧村名が見える。 この地域には史跡や遺跡、寺社や信仰の場に関わる場所が見え、明神裏遺跡、二屋敷遺跡、東山遺跡のような地点が探索の入口になる。 現地では史跡説明板、宮村、曲竹村ゆかりの旧境石標や村の歴史案内板を、既存ピンと照らして歩くと発見しやすい。","story_enrichment":{"samurai_priority_people":[],"notable_people":["永久保秀二郎","平間誠記","伊野上のぼる"],"honorary_citizens":[],"tourism_landmarks":["蔵王連峰","御釜、刈田岳","遠刈田温泉","黄金川温泉","蔵王ハートランド（蔵王酪農センター）","蔵王ブルーベリーファーム","三階の滝（日本の滝百選）","不動滝"],"specialties":[],"food_culture":[],"historical_domains":[],"heian_place_names":[],"japan_search_support":[],"enrichment_sources":["https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%94%B5%E7%8E%8B%E7%94%BA","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q111033505","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11483771","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q138341646","https://jpsearch.go.jp/csearch/jps-cross?csid=jps-cross&keyword=%E6%B0%B8%E4%B9%85%E4%BF%9D%E7%A7%80%E4%BA%8C%E9%83%8E&keyword=%E8%94%B5%E7%8E%8B%E7%94%BA"],"enrichment_errors":[],"wikipedia_title":"蔵王町","wikipedia_revision_id":"110378480","wikidata_qid":"Q1347874","wikipedia_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%94%B5%E7%8E%8B%E7%94%BA","japan_search_query_url":"https://jpsearch.go.jp/csearch/jps-cross?csid=jps-cross&keyword=%E6%B0%B8%E4%B9%85%E4%BF%9D%E7%A7%80%E4%BA%8C%E9%83%8E&keyword=%E8%94%B5%E7%8E%8B%E7%94%BA","status":"wikipedia_ok"}}